    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr. Muhammed Tariq, Associate Professor at AKU, has received an invitation to be part of the Global Faculty at the prestigious Foundation for Advancement of International Medical Education and Research (FAIMER Institute) for the period March 2017- February 2019. In his role as a Global Faculty, Dr Tariq will serve as a Project Advisor for FAIMER fellows during residential and distance learning periods.",
